Description: Temporal knowledge graph library for AI agents
 Graphiti builds and queries bi-temporal knowledge graphs from episodic
 information. It combines semantic, keyword and graph search and supports
 Neo4j for graph storage.
 .
 This package provides the reusable Graphiti Python 3 library.

Package: mcp-server-graphiti
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-graphiti-core (= ${binary:Version}),
 python3-mcp (>= 2),
 python3-openai (>= 2.41.0),
 python3-pydantic-settings,
 python3-typing-extensions,
 python3-yaml (>= 6.0.3),
Suggests:
 python3-falkordb (>= 1.1.2),
Description: MCP server for temporal Graphiti knowledge graphs
 Model Context Protocol server exposing search, ingestion and graph
 maintenance operations backed by Graphiti. The packaged defaults are
 stdio transport with a Neo4j database. Backend initialization is lazy,
 so clients can perform MCP discovery without credentials or a live
 database.
 .
 The companion mcprack package registers this server read-only by default.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-graphiti
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-graphiti (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Graphiti MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-graphiti. Installing it registers the
 mcp-server-graphiti stdio binary in mcprack with mutating tools disabled;
 removing the companion unregisters it.
